      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "# Update:\nWith the planned change that was announced in yesterday’s  Development Update this seems to be even more important. \n```\nWe’ve changed the way you place/move the mirror around in the world.\nInstead of being able to grab the mirror at any time and having a Lock option in the Action Menu, we’ve removed the Lock option and replaced it with “Move”. When you select that option, the mirror will be stuck to your hand and you’ll be able to move it around.\n```\nThis means that every time you want to move the mirror, you need to first go to the Personal Mirror settings page. Which results in you needing to go that sub menu more often. With this change being able to get to it more quickly is even more important, so please consider moving it to the first page of the Action Menu.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
