      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: Franada: When they added the second option in the quick actions, moving it to root were my exact thoughts. It would free up one slot in the expressions menu. \nThe root might become more overwhelming, but there are so many functionalities in the action menu that you need to go to a sub menu of a sub menu anyway to access them. Having features buried behind many clicks produces a real chilling effect on people wanting to use them.",
