  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2022-08-03T15:27:50.770Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nRight now, there the Portable Mirror is hidden in the `Options` category of the `Action Menu`. This results in it taking longer going from your normal Expression Menu to the portable Mirror and can result in accidentally pressing the wrong button because the `Options` sub menu is already relatively full.\n# Suggestion:\nThe Portable Mirror is something people want to access fast, especially going from your Expression Menu to it and back. It’s also something new people should easily be able to find.\nSo my suggestion is to move it to the first page of the `Action Menu`, that way you make it easy to find and fast to access. The first page also only has 3 options currently, adding a 4th one should not add any clutter to it, it probably makes it even faster to use since with a thumb stick you can go up / down and right / left. (It also removes clutter from the `Options` which is already relatively full)",
